# up-beeblum ignore policy — the exact effective set:
# .issues/ (the issue-store worktree), .opencode/ (the agent deck checkout),
# private/ (rights-restricted material), tmp/ (session scratch), outputs/
# (generated outputs), and the LaTeX byproduct extensions.
# (These contents never enter history.)
.issues/
.opencode/
private/
tmp/
outputs/
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
__pycache__/
